OL,3,GNEWSAMan found with 'homemade petrol
OL,4,Abomb' charged
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man alleged to have made a "homemade
OL,7,Fpetrol bomb" has been charged with
OL,8,Fmaking an explosive device.
OL,10,FThe man, from Aberfan, Merthyr Tydfil,
OL,11,Fis alleged to have made the "explosive
OL,12,Fdevice with intent to endanger
OL,13,Flife/injure property" on 17 October.
OL,15,FHe has appeared before magistrates in
OL,16,FMerthyr Tydfil, and has been held in
OL,17,Fcustody.
OL,19,FThe next court appearance is on 5
OL,20,FNovember.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
